    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="0800" n="779" sameAs="frus:frus1948v04/pg779"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760D.6111/4–1648: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Legation in Finland
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-04-21T14:00:00-05:00">April 21, 1948—2
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>92. At least until fully informed as to possible unpublished protocols Dept does
                    not expect to comment on pact (Legtel 251 Apr 16<anchor n="1" xml:id="d510-f1"
                    />) and in any case does not desire influence Finnish decision on
                    ratification.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
